Subject: [PATCH] wsi/display: add opt-in Neo3 dual-DMA scanout

Use the verified Neo3 half-screen DMA2/3 geometry after primary initialization.
Keep the existing flip-event and GPU-fence path; update both planes in one
atomic commit. Opt-in is restricted to KGSL DSI and validated vendor DMA caps.
No physical GPU acceptance is established by this patch alone.

